WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
This is one thing that Democrats do understand.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.400
Politics is about power,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.200
and you can't implement your principles

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.280
if you don't have power.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.520
Republicans should take heed.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.520
We're not saying be as crazy as they are

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.440
because senators are lunging at cabinet secretaries

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.240
and then claiming it never happened.

